{"ref":"BDB, לְחִי","hw":"לְחִי","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">לְחִי</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup>Ct 1:10</sup> <strong>jaw, cheek (</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">לוֹחָא</span>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">لَحْىٌ</span>; on Assyrian <em>laḫû</em> cf. Dl<sup>HWB 375</sup>, but ح = <em>ḫ</em>?<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ל׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:17\" href=\"/Judges.15.17\">Ju 15:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:14\" href=\"/Micah.4.14\">Mi 4:14</a>; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:15\" href=\"/Judges.15.15\">Ju 15:15</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶ֑חִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:24\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.24\">1 K 22:24</a> + 3 times + <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:19\" href=\"/Judges.15.19\">Ju 15:19</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֱיוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 40:26\" href=\"/Job.40.26\">Jb 40:26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֱיָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:2\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.2\">La 1:2</a>; du. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְחָיַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.3\">Dt 18:3</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְחָיֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.28\">Is 30:28</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְחָיַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.6\">Is 50:6</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 16:10\" href=\"/Job.16.10\">Jb 16:10</a>, etc.; <span dir=\"rtl\">לְחֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 11:4\" href=\"/Hosea.11.4\">Ho 11:4</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>jaw, jawbone</em>, of animal, <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:15\" href=\"/Judges.15.15\">Ju 15:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:16\" href=\"/Judges.15.16\">16</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:17\" href=\"/Judges.15.17\">17</a> (under jaw of ass), cf. n.pr.loc. <span dir=\"rtl\">רָמַת לֶ֑חִי</span> v <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:17\" href=\"/Judges.15.17\">17</a>; in sim. <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּמְרִימֵי עֹל עַל־לְחֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 11:4\" href=\"/Hosea.11.4\">Ho 11:4</a> <em>like those lifting up a yoke from upon</em> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵעַל</span>?) <em>their jaws</em> (Isr. under fig. of oxen); of sacrificial ox or sheep <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.3\">Dt 18:3</a>; of crocodile <a data-ref=\"Job 40:26\" href=\"/Job.40.26\">Jb 40:26</a>; of Pharaoh under fig. of <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּנִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.4\">Ez 29:4</a> (cf. v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.3\">3</a>); cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.4\">38:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.28\">Is 30:28</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>cheek</em>, of man <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:24\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.24\">1 K 22:24</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 18:23\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.18.23\">2 Ch 18:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 16:10\" href=\"/Job.16.10\">Jb 16:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 3:8\" href=\"/Psalms.3.8\">ψ 3:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 5:13\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.5.13\">Ct 5:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.6\">Is 50:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:30\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.30\">La 3:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:14\" href=\"/Micah.4.14\">Mi 4:14</a>; of woman <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:10\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.10\">Ct 1:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:2\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.2\">La 1:2</a> (fig. of Jerusalem).","next":"BDB, לְחִי²","prev":"BDB, לחה"}